metadata={'input_tokens': 4160, 'output_tokens': 1031, 'total_tokens': 5191}), ToolMessage(content='NAME                               READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE\naccounting-844d99ddff-r9mf9        1/1     Running   0          3m51s\nad-6f9964ffd8-2hlpf                1/1     Running   0          3m49s\ncart-65474cd577-jntsd              1/1     Running   0          3m49s\ncheckout-648b497649-46xgg          1/1     Running   0          3m50s\ncurrency-69f5b55bbc-vjcbp          1/1     Running   0          3m51s\nemail-56985bb4f8-48j48             1/1     Running   0          3m49s\nflagd-79c4c6cb44-zh4js             2/2     Running   0          3m48s\nfraud-detection-88b76487c-r67dv    1/1     Running   0          3m51s\nfrontend-65c7cd5577-vstck          1/1     Running   0          3m48s\nfrontend-proxy-84788b44b-rgxp5     1/1     Running   0          3m50s\ngrafana-bdbfb995f-tg4rc            4/4     Running   0          3m47s\nimage-provider-6c7d4665cc-hx9r5    1/1     Running   0          3m50s\njaeger-6d6f47c768-jkbn5            1/1     Running   0          3m47s\nkafka-74ccb7b5fd-nz6lb             1/1     Running   0          3m51s\nllm-55b9d48bb4-mpfk4               1/1     Running   0          3m50s\nload-generator-9895cc8bf-4j6rq     1/1     Running   0          3m49s\nlocust-fetcher                     1/1     Running   0          84s\nopensearch-0                       1/1     Running   0          3m50s\notel-collector-agent-56z55         1/1     Running   0          62s\notel-collector-agent-dxslv         1/1     Running   0          71s\notel-collector-agent-gbw2h         1/1     Running   0          81s\npayment-fbfc99665-plclh            1/1     Running   0          3m51s\npostgresql-68c5b8f59b-mft4f        1/1     Running   0          3m50s\nproduct-catalog-f57789b6d-kj2t5    1/1     Running   0          3m50s\nproduct-reviews-6f447976bc-9g2rl   1/1     Running   0          3m47s\nquote-bc9b88d7d-qgl2w              1/1     Running   0          