    5m18s\nquote-bc9b88d7d-qgl2w              1/1     Running   0          5m21s\nrecommendation-77b6cd7dc6-ktsn7    1/1     Running   0          5m21s\nshipping-54f9758cb5-kdj2w          1/1     Running   0          5m18s\nvalkey-cart-6c4f7cf8f6-s6f58       1/1     Running   0          5m21s\n', id='f8e8a031-c18e-4c29-a136-383876c2143c', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-ab7dfb9892bcac87'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choose a tool from the available tools and justify your choice.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='d0369713-70ff-4a5c-94ae-ff3e6085b37f')]]
