 is the absence of `jaeger-out`, which is likely a typo or a missing deployment.\n\nThe user then tried checking deployments and pods, but `jaeger-out` wasn't found. They moved on to checking ConfigMaps to see if the service name is misconfigured there. The next step is to inspect the ConfigMaps for any references to `jaeger-out` that might be causing the application to use the wrong service name. If they find such a reference, they can correct it to use `jaeger` instead. If not, they might need to deploy the missing `jaeger-out` service or adjust the application's configuration accordingly.\n</think>\n\n", additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl get configmaps -n astronomy-shop"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-90339a41da00bcac', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 480, 'prompt_tokens': 6099, 'total_tokens': 6579, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfdae-4d20-7ed1-b92c-1b1f44c13a57-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl get configmaps -n astronomy-shop'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-90339a41da00bcac', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 6099, 'output_tokens': 480, 'total_tokens': 6579}), ToolMessage(content='NAME                                        DATA   AGE\nflagd-config                                1      5m40s\ngrafana                                     2      5m40s\ngrafana-alerting                            0      5m40s\ngrafana-config-dashboards                   1      5m40s\ngrafana-dashboard-apm-dashboard             1      5m40s\ngrafana-dashboard-demo-dashboard            1      5m40s\ngrafana-dashboard-exemplars-dashboard       1